[sirens wailing]

1314
01:42:33,189 --> 01:42:34,190
Dad?

1315
01:42:35,817 --> 01:42:36,818
Dad!

1316
01:42:37,819 --> 01:42:38,820
- Dad!
- I love you.

1317
01:42:38,903 --> 01:42:39,904
